The Housing & Community Development Advisory Council's priorities are to serve the low to moderate-
income population.  The grant recipients have to demonstrate that their clients are low to moderate-
income city residents.  The majority of their clients live in Census Tracts 2, 3, 7, and 10, which are the
City of Cheyenne's low income neighborhoods.  It is estimated that approximately 90% of our grant
allocation will be dedicated to these low income neighborhoods.
