moderate-income residents of Cheyenne with 6 bus routes.
Needs, Inc. - $19,000.  Their main office is located in Census Tract 2, Block 2.  All of their assistance will
be given to low to moderate income residents of Cheyenne.
CLIMB Wyoming - $19,000.  Their main office is located in Census Tract 7, Block 1.  They assist low to
moderate-income single mothers with employment training.
