All of their assistance will be given to low to moderate-income residents of Cheyenne.
Wyoming Independent Living Rehabilitation - $29,280.  Their main office is located in Census Tract 7,
Block 3.  They only assist low to moderate-income disabled homeowners of Cheyenne.
