The CHA has recently applied for HOME – Low Income Housing Tax Credits for the McGowan Place
Apartments development located at 325 & 327 East Prosser Road in Cheyenne.  The project will provide
48 units of housing for low income residents.  The project will provide eight (8) one bedroom one bath
units, twenty-six (26) two bedroom two bath units, and thirteen (13) three bedroom two bath units.
